{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id581898464"}, "name":{"label":"NotSpongebob233"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-19T20:11:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"178"}, "id":{"label":"13768403627"}, "title":{"label":"Better help popup made app inaccessible."}, "content":{"label":"I don’t know if this is a bug or if this is intentional but when I try and access the app, it pops up a window paired with better help therapy and I can’t exit out of it. It doesn’t matter if I click on the link or exit out of the app it just pops  how am I supposed to use the app if you’re gonna put up a pop-up window that leads me to a different site? Please fix your app. \nWhat’s the point of having this app if I can’t use it? Seriously it was a helpful app but now that I can’t access it for my needs it feels pointless. I already have therapy. I don’t need more. I need this app to do what it’s designed to do, not shove a partnership down my throat tha I can’t say no to.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
