{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1276345415"}, "name":{"label":"Dexlen Estill"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-19T06:51:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"177"}, "id":{"label":"13766364354"}, "title":{"label":"FIX THE BETTERHELP PROMO"}, "content":{"label":"I understand you have a partnership, and that’s awesome. But I can’t use the app to track, if I have an urge or to even see what others in the community are dealing with because this ad for the “BetterHelp” partnership keeps popping up. You can’t close out of it, if you click it then go back it doesn’t go away, and if you refresh the app it pops back up. I’m already in therapy, I don’t want the promotion. I don’t appreciate being able to use the app either. Just give us a option to close out of the promo or I’ll find a way to request a refund for the yearly plan because this doesn’t help me at all if I can’t use the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1402958214"}, "name":{"label":"BobbyHayes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-19T06:26:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"177"}, "id":{"label":"13766285815"}, "title":{"label":"Bugged payment no response"}, "content":{"label":"After downloading the app, I decided to choose the lifetime membership fee for $50. It ended up going through my Apple Pay, but for some reason, it did not register that I had a membership so I tried it again. Another $50 got charged to my bank account still did not have a membership. I then finally decided to go with the $20 one year plan they started my membership. I emailed the company twice to get refunded. They never responded. I disputed both these charges through Apple twice. Apple said neither of them are eligible for refund even though it’s the same charge on my account two times in a row in the same day. I then had to dispute the charges through my bank. Now when I go to open the app, there’s not even a spot for me to press to login. It just says become a member today. The idea is awesome. The execution is terrible. I still have not been refunded my money and I no longer have a membership will not be using this app again", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
